# This is an npm project (package-lock.json). pnpm-lock.yaml only appears when
# something shells out to pnpm — `shadcn add` does, via its own pnpm install —
# and committing it here desynchronises the two lockfiles: CI runs `npm ci`,
# which fails outright when package.json and package-lock.json disagree.
pnpm-lock.yaml
